{
  "supplier_id": {{supplierId}},
  "purchase_requisition_id": {{requisitionId}},
  "number": "OC-2026-0004",
  "order_date": "2026-09-17",
  "currency": "PEN",
  "items": [
    { "purchase_requisition_item_id": {{requisitionItem3Id}}, "description": "Alambre N°16", "quantity_ordered": 5, "line_total": 40 }
  ]
}

###
@requisitionOrderId = {{requisitionOrder.response.body.$.purchase_order_id}}

### 6C.5 Listar (filtros opcionales: proveedor, requerimiento, cotización, texto) / obtener
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/purchase-orders?purchase_requisition_id={{requisitionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/purchase-orders?quotation_id={{quotationId}}&supplier_id={{supplierId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/purchase-orders?search=OC-2026
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
